kan_ft_ofl3.traineddata (release v0.2.0)
========================================

Based on kan.traineddata by the Tesseract OCR project, from
https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_best (the file at commit
9ddc24e750eec0994223a9edc3fcb434a2244f3b, unchanged since), which the
repository licenses under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Modifications copyright 2026 The Open Kannada Authors.

What changed, in November 2026: the LSTM network was trained further on
Kannada text lines, and the character set was extended. The word, number and
punctuation lists are unchanged.

The model file is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see
LICENSE-MODEL. Anyone who redistributes it should include LICENSE-MODEL and
this NOTICE.

The model file contains no training text or images. The network was trained
on the openly licensed material credited below, and the model card,
https://github.com/openkannada/kannada-ocr/blob/v0.2.0/docs/model-card.md,
lists every source with its license. The material was changed for training:
scans were cut into line images, some of them downscaled; texts were
normalized with kannadi and split into lines, and some lines were rendered in
fonts and degraded to look like print.

This model is not trained on ಸಂದೇಶದ ಕಥೆಗಳು (2001), whose scan is tagged
public domain on Commons; a book from 2001 is very likely still under
copyright, so the tag is probably wrong. sources/excluded-training-books.json
lists it. kan_ft_ofl2.traineddata in release v0.1.0 was trained on 1659 of
its lines, and is otherwise trained on the same sources.

